# The Piper PA-28-180 Cherokee: JSBSim's pa28 made to fly to its handbook's
# figures (assets/figures/pa28.xml) by tools/make_pa28.py.
#
#   name TEXT...                 what it is called
#   model NAME                   its JSBSim model, in data/jsbsim/aircraft
#   start AIRSPEED_KT THROTTLE   a flight begun in the air: its calibrated
#                                airspeed, and the throttle that holds it
#
# Its published figures, if it has them, are data/figures/MODEL.xml, and its
# selftest's log data/selftest/MODEL.log (src/sim/catalogue.hpp).

name Piper PA-28-180 Cherokee
model pa28
class light-aircraft
start 110 0.82
# Full rich under 5,000 ft, as its handbook has it ("the mixture should be
# in the FULL RICH position for all operations under 5000 feet", section
# III, cruising), and leaned above.
mixture-lever 5000
